{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52076","headline":"祀五方用舒和歌 · 褚亮","name":"祀五方用舒和歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌龠舞属年韶，鹭鼓凫钟展时豫。\n调露初迎绮春节。\n承云遽践苍霄驭。\n（见《唐诗纪事》卷四）（按：《祀五方上帝五郊乐》，《旧唐书》卷三十《音乐志》三云「贞观中魏徵等作」。\n《全唐诗》卷三一均收魏徵名下，实误。\n《纪事》以此首爲亮作，必有所据，故录出之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}